{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3582470/extras/Rage_Room_Catharsis.png?t=1747383176\" />Are you ready to unleash your anger and do what you can't in the real world?\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Rage Room: Catharsis</strong> is here to help you release all your stress, frustration, and anger in a safe environment! Smashing things in real life can be expensive, but here? <strong>The more you break, the better!</strong>\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udd25 <strong>Another never-ending meeting at work?</strong>\u00a0<br> \ud83d\udc94 <strong>Your crush just said, &quot;You're great, but...&quot;?</strong>\u00a0<br> \ud83d\ude97 <strong>Stuck in traffic for hours?</strong>\u00a0<br> \ud83d\uded2 <strong>That item in your cart just got more expensive?</strong>\u00a0<br> \ud83d\udcfa <strong>So frustrated you feel like throwing the remote at the TV?</strong>\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Then <strong>don\u2019t destroy the real world\u2014destroy everything around you!</strong> <strong>Rage Room: Catharsis</strong> offers a VR stress-relief experience packed with realistic physics and destruction mechanics.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udd28 <strong>Smash, break, destroy!</strong> Grab a sledgehammer and turn everything into dust.\u00a0<br> \u26a1 <strong>Slow Motion Mode:</strong> Feel like an action movie star and watch every impact in slow motion!\u00a0 </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83c\udfaf <strong>Game Modes:</strong>\u00a0</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Challenge Mode:</strong> <strong>Race against time!</strong> Complete 10 different tasks by smashing the target objects within a time limit.\u00a0</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Free Roam Mode:</strong> <strong>No rules, no limits!</strong> Smash as much as you want, however you want!\u00a0</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udd13 <strong>Unlock New Weapons:</strong> Baseball bats, sledgehammers, pistols\u2026 Create chaos your way!\u00a0<br>\u00a0\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Don\u2019t hold your anger in\u2014<strong>release it with &quot;Rage Room: Catharsis&quot;!</strong> Do what you can't in real life, relax, and have fun!\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udca5 <strong>Now, let the chaos begin!</strong> \ud83d\udca5\u00a0</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3582470?t=1747383176","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3582470/82cc9e93099d1b7b531ee7d778db8ccf5b16cf97/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1747383176","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3582470/e23ffbab1d308a21429a86ca28773b6a46e4db19/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1747383176","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3582470/e23ffbab1d308a21429a86ca28773b6a46e4db19/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1747383176","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Tracked Controller Support","id":52},{"description":"VR Only","id":54},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3582470/extras/Rage_Room_Catharsis.png?t=1747383176\" />Are you ready to unleash your anger and do what you can't in the real world?\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Rage Room: Catharsis</strong> is here to help you release all your stress, frustration, and anger in a safe environment! Smashing things in real life can be expensive, but here? <strong>The